	      sor.  If you want cursor line to always be in the middle of  the
	      view (except at the beginning or end of the file list), set this
	      option to some large value (e.g. 999).

       'sessionoptions' 'ssop'
	      sessionoptions ssop
	      type: set
	      default: tui,state,tabs,savedirs,dhistory
